      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "誰かと思ったら美琴か",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんな朝早くにどうしたんだ？\r\n何か忘れ物でもしたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025005060070,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "ううん、忘れ物とか\r\nそういうのじゃなくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025005060080,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "レッスン室の鍵を借りようと思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……そういうことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025005060090,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "もしかして\r\n誰か使う予定がある？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……\r\n今日は特に予定は入ってないはずだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025005060100,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……そう\r\nよかった",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、使ってもらうのは\r\n構わないけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺としては、久しぶりのオフなんだから\r\n美琴にしっかり休んでほしいんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025005060110,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "うん……でも休んでいるだけだと\r\n時間がもったいないし",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025005060120,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "私は練習している時が\r\n一番落ち着くから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……そう言うと思ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただ、美琴のプロデューサーとして\r\n心配だけはさせてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1025005060130,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "それは……うん\r\nプロデューサーの好きにしたらいいよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102500506/1025005060130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう！\r\n好きにさせてもらうからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
